# --- Notifications-only additions (the rest of this file matches the sibling services verbatim) ---

# The Dockerfile builds src/Notifications.AppHost, never the solution, so neither of these reaches
# the image. Excluding them keeps the `COPY . .` layer from being invalidated by a workflow edit,
# which is most of the churn in this repo. No tests/ directory exists yet; kept pre-emptively so a
# future test project doesn't require a second edit here.
tests
.github

# Documentation, for the same cache reason. The verbatim block above already excludes README.md by
# name; this generalises it, so a new .md file cannot silently start invalidating the build layer.
**/*.md